\f1\b0 \cf0 \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Overfitting is a drawback of decision trees is their tendency to overfit the training data. When a tree becomes too complex\'97attempting to account for every minor detail, \
	       including random noise\'97it may perform poorly on unseen data.\
